{
  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-4TX6l7C4\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3f2cclmp\">本章节主要介绍API上报线索流程及<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1794759460056076\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取本地推线索列表</a>与<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/37/docs/1805613694863499\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">线索回传</a>相关能力。</p></blockquote><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YdpH7%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-KXhBsiFm%5C%22%3E%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87API%E5%9B%9E%E4%BC%A0%E4%B8%8A%E6%8A%A5%E7%BA%BF%E7%B4%A2%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E3%80%81%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E5%90%8E%E6%95%88%EF%BC%8C%E5%B0%86%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E6%8E%A8%E9%80%81%E7%BB%99%E6%9B%B4%E5%80%BE%E5%90%91%E4%BA%8E%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%EF%BC%9BAPI%E5%9B%9E%E4%BC%A0%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%9B%9E%E4%BC%A0%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E5%B9%B6%E6%A0%87%E8%AE%B0%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E6%A0%87%E7%AD%BE%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%A5%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B9%9F%E5%B0%86%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%92%8C%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%B8%AE%E5%8A%A9%E6%82%A8%E6%8E%92%E6%9F%A5%E5%90%8E%E6%95%88%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-KXhBsiFm\">通过API回传上报线索深度转化事件，可帮助优化营销投放、提高后效，将营销推送给更倾向于发生转化行为的客户；API回传接口同时支持回传无效事件并标记无效类型标签，该数据也将用于模型优化和支持帮助您排查后效问题。</p></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-Wdc7N5jI\" id=\"h490b8bf-JBgMbc8C\">1 完成投放前准备</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-OWPzl7b0\">在投放前，需要获得有效token，以便在投放后对线索进行及时的拉取、跟进和标记回传。获得有效token，需要在巨量引擎开放后台完成开发者注册并申请APPID应用，客户（投放账户advertiser_id）完成对APPID的投放账户授权后，使用授权后的auth_code换取有效token，APPID后续可使用对应的有效token进行接口调用。进行授权并获得token的方法参考<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710502277120\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">帮助文档</a>。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-69OdwuzU\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/d5cc9bd015ba41f4b44da90f4f57baba~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2037352874&amp;x-signature=tloRlLnhGDmEUzlAqrwxIAQ%2Bkeo%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-bD41cK6j\" id=\"h490b8bf-Vjg0lVZl\">2 在本地推开始投放</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZyIjW48P\">完成投放准备后，可在本地推进行营销投放。</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-JPoSAbHg\" id=\"h490b8bf-AjI7bgl5\"><img data-auto=\"true\" data-type=\"inline\" src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/3d1388016a884b54b022715e1b003c84~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2037352970&amp;x-signature=NkqSK66yC%2BTiVcBtItkBy%2F90krU%3D\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\"/></h2><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-S4YoYSDi\" id=\"h490b8bf-9sv2fAeQ\">3 通过API回传线索</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-tvlazvCK\">开始投放后，可通过API进行留资线索的跟进和事件的回传，具体分为三步：通过接口进行线索拉取、对拉取线索进行跟进和事件标记、对标记有深转或无效事件的线索通过接口及时进行回传。</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-idMjDCmL\" id=\"h6f20189-EBS2OMc1\">3.1 拉取线索：</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-ScxBDCxQ\">通过接口请求将本地推营销投放数据拉取到自己的CRM平台中，进行后续的线索跟进和管理，接口请求方法参考文档：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/37/docs/1794759460056076\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取本地推线索列表</a>。</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-h543f5Oc\" id=\"h6f20189-XjMVeLNO\">3.2 按规则处理线索：</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-TwhihHpu\">为使投放模型可以更好地学习数据、进一步优化投放，需要根据线索跟进情况对线索进行标记，并通过在回传时对<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">clue_convert_state</code>字段进行相应赋值实现对线索的标记。目前支持回传以下类型事件。</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t75ae23f-GmFIBSFK\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-XYPRBWLD\"><col data-id=\"cd800f02-mJCgZmlo\" span=\"1\" width=\"17.4061433447099%\"/><col data-id=\"c705041b-Sg27Ma19\" span=\"1\" width=\"24.118316268486918%\"/><col data-id=\"ca74826f-bRl59FhJ\" span=\"1\" width=\"58.47554038680318%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-Sbf0qTAo\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-xL2uXUX3\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"te5b348d-DQIlRYHB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CCD88Xv8\">clue_convert_state</p></td><td data-id=\"te5b348d-ppojTW3U\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-txXzi7kY\">事件名称</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t0c8947a-hEKcZZHX\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8TGNxjvg\">事件含义</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-bbE5XtKL\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-dGc7sd05\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-t9kV4GaO\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">CLUE_CONFIRM</span></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-eN6Wfjvt\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-yLixyGQU\">顾客表达有意向</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-mgU1dS4Y\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-S0xh6c0A\">代表线索初步清洗和跟进后，确认留资顾客表达有意向，可进一步跟进</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-j3E2pLHE\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-98rrLjZ0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QIL0dI4J\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">CLUE_HIGH_INTENTION</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-ULJGngPR\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zG7EdII5\">定金或钩子品支付</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-qJe2nXdz\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DNnA7Uar\">代表顾客进行了支付定金或购买钩子品的行为</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-qAO8Vusd\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-aF8ogwpF\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-q206HvV2\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">ARRIVAL</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-V81g4q5o\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-PDZlEYun\">顾客到店/销售人员上门</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-pgNeIwGI\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-OBVzpj4U\">代表顾客线下到店，或销售人员成功上门与顾客进行线下沟通</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-fp32NCto\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-g6qEQalB\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-z6AF0dm8\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">CONVERSION_CLASS</span></p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-vThytko6\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9mn0XHLW\">正价支付</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-lfGfpdGu\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mEiSEHrc\">代表顾客以正常价格购买了非钩子品的商品或服务</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-d5Cps6oY\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-5iJYnkj7\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kD34TKim\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">INVALID_EVENT</span></p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-ZDUDIDaW\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-FUEr3Fef\">无效事件</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-CLd4KlMQ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7YOumsPM\">代表线索跟进后，放弃或确认不会发生后续转化行为的无效线索</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-mYZBhsRU\">选择线索状态后，您可以使用<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">reason_code</code>字段将线索状态所属具体场景进行打标签。全行业的客户可使用通用标签进行标记，家居建材及教育行业的客户还可以使用更为详细的专属标签进行标记。为方便帮您优化线索有效性和数据分析。选择无效标签是建议您选择具体的无效标签，<strong>不建议您选择“其它”</strong>。</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t61fe7cd-FLOLnRkD\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-ghEhNJCV\"><col data-id=\"c488d3ee-QaUXjgWA\" span=\"1\" width=\"21.160409556313994%\"/><col data-id=\"c8768938-hPO8oQBi\" span=\"1\" width=\"37.54266211604095%\"/><col data-id=\"c23398e4-OkNkJgnf\" span=\"1\" width=\"41.29692832764505%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-5O2Xn5k9\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-WQi4GzzO\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"ta3eb991-SPacU3eC\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-huqkdz83\">线索状态-行业</p></td><td data-id=\"ta3eb991-PKjkj2B8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-2Xew600l\">reason_code</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"tb737e05-2Q849eFE\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(245, 245, 245); min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-4uMaHF51\">标签类型</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-iT9FzCu6\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t59b4bc9-2l67bJ51\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" rowspan=\"6\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oWsbzM0S\">无效标签-通用</p></td><td data-id=\"tff4a61f-V2pYZAlm\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-abB1Zp0o\">CALL_THREE_TIMES_NO_RESPONSE</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-Y86QtYhj\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tUdgtVST\">拨打3次以上未接通</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-eo4BIIgf\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-Zq06hUxu\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-H2aoRfPv\">INVALID_NUMBER</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-Nhg7xHx2\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GvPW99B5\">空号/停机/关机</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-4SfTfykR\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-v1NwZ6eJ\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-wid