pan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DqdPYGVr\">正价品支付-家居建材</p></td><td colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t882b249-YQVuNhcv\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-lWNSEFEG\">HOME_CONTRACT_SIGNED</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t7e901cd-LYiF7Cf8\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ar19MgUi\">已签约</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t8bf3a1f-nqeHHKKB\" style=\"height: 35px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tfdb4f7e-01aUGYYM\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-UbJ0Rks7\">HOME_SERVICE_DELIVERY_COMPLETED</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row table-last-column\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t632832e-66Hd1RgP\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MoVV0r44\">已完成服务交付</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-XRB46DPD\" id=\"h6f20189-jBAS3i2j\">3.3 回传数据</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-GlP5qEML\">对线索进行跟进后，标记有深转事件或无效的线索请及时通过接口进行回传，供投放模型进行学习和优化。回传接口及方法参考文档：<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/37/docs/1805613694863499\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">线索回传</a>。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-yXLUW59Y\"><br/></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-d489BmXh\" id=\"h490b8bf-cg2xXMxn\">4 通过来客平台查看回传数据</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-6Id8VXnP\">前往来客平台查看通过API回传的线索深转事件，功能规划中，敬请期待。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-d3sBhrFr\"><br/></p></div>",
